at the Millgate depot walks the north corridor every weekday from 7 am till 8 am.\",\"line\":7,\"span\":\"The duty officer walks the north corridor every weekday from 7 am till 8 am, right after the shift handover.\"},{\"text\":\"The duty officer's north corridor round at the Millgate depot takes place right after the shift handover.\",\"line\":7,\"span\":\"The duty officer walks the north corridor every weekday from 7 am till 8 am, right after the shift handover.\"},{\"text\":\"A second round at the Millgate depot covers the workshop and the paint store.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"A second round covers the workshop and the paint store from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only.\"},{\"text\":\"The second round at the Millgate depot runs from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"A second round covers the workshop and the paint store from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only.\"},{\"text\":\"The site manager of the Millgate depot has asked for a third round for years.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"The site manager has asked for a third round for years, but the budget has never allowed it.\"},{\"text\":\"The budget has never allowed a third round at the Millgate depot.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"The site manager has asked for a third round for years, but the budget has never allowed it.\"},{\"text\":\"Frost swells the timber frames on the older doors at the Millgate depot.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Frost swells the timber frames on the older doors, so between November and February several of them will not latch unless pulled hard.\"},{\"text\":\"Between November and February several of the older doors at the Millgate depot will not latch unless pulled hard.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Frost swells the timber frames on the older doors, so between November and February several of them will not latch unless pulled hard.\"},{\"text\":\"Once the frames dry out in spring, the older doors at the Millgate depot close cleanly again.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"Once the frames dry out in spring, the same doors close cleanly again.\"},{\"text\":\"The fire doors at the Millgate depot are the responsibility of the site.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"While the doors are the responsibility of the site, the certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor who attends every March 1st to March 31st.\"},{\"text\":\"The certified inspection of the fire doors at the Millgate depot is carried out by an outside contractor.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"While the doors are the responsibility of the site, the certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor who attends every March 1st to March 31st.\"},{\"text\":\"The outside contractor attends the Millgate depot every March 1st to March 31st.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"While the doors are the responsibility of the site, the certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor who attends every March 1st to March 31st.\"},{\"text\":\"During the visit the contractor tags each fire door at the Millgate depot.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"During that visit the contractor tags each door, photographs the closer, and leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors.\"},{\"text\":\"During the visit the contractor photographs the closer of each fire door at the Millgate depot.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"During that visit the contractor tags each door, photographs the closer, and leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors.\"},{\"text\":\"During the visit the contractor leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse of the Millgate depot for the auditors.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"During that visit the contractor tags each door, photographs the closer, and leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors.\"},{\"text\":\"At the Millgate depot, whoever finds a fire door defect writes it in the log.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"It became custom that whoever finds a defect writes it in the log and pins a yellow card to the door itself.\"},{\"text\":\"At the Millgate depot, whoever finds a fire door defect pins a yellow card to the door itself.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"It became custom that whoever finds a defect writes it in the log and pins a yellow card to the door itself.\"},{\"text\":\"The yellow card stays on the fire door until the repair is signed off.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"The card stays there until the repair is signed off.\"},{\"text\":\"Staff at the Millgate depot have started betting on whether the yellow card or the written record is cleared first.\",\"line\":23,\"span\":\"Staff have started betting on whether the card or the written record is cleared first.\"},{\"text\":\"In most cases the clearing of the yellow card and the written record is a tie.\",\"line\":24,\"span\":\"In most cases it is a tie, because one officer clears both at the end of the week.\"},{\"text\":\"One officer clears both the yellow card and the written record at the end of the week.\",\"line\":24,\"span\":\"In most cases it is a tie, because one officer clears both at the end of the week.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club has met in the small canteen on Tuesday lunchtimes.\",\"line\":28,\"span\":\"The chess club has met in the small canteen on Tuesday lunchtimes ever since it was started by two apprentices from the drawing office.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club was started by two apprentices from the drawing office.\",\"line\":28,\"span\":\"The chess club has met in the small canteen on Tuesday lunchtimes ever since it was started by two apprentices from the drawing office.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club does not meet between mid July and early September.\",\"line\":32,\"span\":\"The club does not meet between mid July and early September, because most members take leave and the canteen is closed for cleaning.\"},{\"text\":\"Most chess club members take leave between mid July and early September.\",\"line\":32,\"span\":\"The club does not meet between mid July and early September, because most members take leave and the canteen is closed for cleaning.\"},{\"text\":\"The canteen is closed for cleaning between mid July and early September.\",\"line\":32,\"span\":\"The club does not meet between mid July and early September, because most members take leave and the canteen is closed for cleaning.\"},{\"text\":\"Chess club play resumes on the first Tuesday of term.\",\"line\":33,\"span\":\"Play resumes on the first Tuesday of term.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club members leave the boards set up rather than pack them away.\",\"line\":33,\"span\":\"Over the years the members have learned to leave the boards set up rather than pack them away.\"},{\"text\":\"Outsiders assume the chess club is only for people who already play well.\",\"line\":37,\"span\":\"While outsiders assume the club is only for people who already play well, the truth is a good deal duller.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club does not use a rating system.\",\"line\":37,\"span\":\"Instead of a rating system, the club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point.\",\"line\":37,\"span\":\"Instead of a rating system, the club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point.\"},{\"text\":\"Chess club members who win a game move up one place on the ladder.\",\"line\":38,\"span\":\"Members who win a game move up one place, and the person they beat moves down one place.\"},{\"text\":\"The person a chess club member beats moves down one place on the ladder.\",\"line\":38,\"span\":\"Members who win a game move up one place, and the person they beat moves down one place.\"},{\"text\":\"In one wet autumn the chess club was invited to play a county side.\",\"line\":42,\"span\":\"In one wet autumn the club was invited to play a county side, and nobody had expected the invitation.\"},{\"text\":\"Nobody had expected the invitation for the chess club to play a county side.\",\"line\":42,\"span\":\"In one wet autumn the club was invited to play a county side, and nobody had expected the invitation.\"},{\"text\":\"One apprentice agreed to play on the top board against the county side at two days' notice.\",\"line\":42,\"span\":\"In a rush to field a full team, one apprentice agreed to play on the top board at two days' notice.\"},{\"text\":\"It took the apprentice the whole weekend to prepare for the county match.\",\"line\":43,\"span\":\"It took him the whole weekend to prepare, and he studied openings he had never used.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice studied openings he had never used to prepare for the county match.\",\"line\":43,\"span\":\"It took him the whole weekend to prepare, and he studied openings he had never used.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice lost his notes on the train.\",\"line\":43,\"span\":\"He also lost his notes on the train.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice arrived on time for the county match.\",\"line\":44,\"span\":\"But he arrived on time.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice shook hands and sat down at the county match.\",\"line\":44,\"span\":\"He shook hands, sat down and played the quietest game of his life.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice played the quietest game of his life at the county match.\",\"line\":44,\"span\":\"He shook hands, sat down and played the quietest game of his life.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice's game in the county match was adjourned.\",\"line\":45,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"The arbiter counted the material when the apprentice's game was adjourned.\",\"line\":45,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice was a pawn ahead when the game was adjourned.\",\"line\":45,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice offered a draw.\",\"line\":45,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"The county side accepted the apprentice's offer of a draw.\",\"line\":45,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"After the match, the county side gave the chess club enough spare clocks to run every board on the ladder at the same time.\",\"line\":49,\"span\":\"When the match was over, the county side gave the club enough spare clocks to run every board on the ladder at the same time.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice travelled home after the county match.\",\"line\":50,\"span\":\"He travelled home and told everyone in the drawing office about the game until they asked him to stop.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice told everyone in the drawing office about the county match game until they asked him to stop.\",\"line\":50,\"span\":\"He travelled home and told everyone in the drawing office about the game until they asked him to stop.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club eventually grew to thirty members.\",\"line\":51,\"span\":\"Eventually the club grew to thirty members, and from then on the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday so that nobody had to stand.\"},{\"text\":\"After the chess club grew to thirty members, the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday so that nobody had to stand.\",\"line\":51,\"span\":\"Eventually the club grew to thirty members, and from then on the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday so that nobody had to stand.\"}]}","ttft_ms":26008,"type":"result","duration_ms":26050,"uuid":"b7fef40c-619d-4bdf-8c76-47bbe2d64790","ttft_stream_ms":1639,"time_to_request_ms":95,"first_content_frame_ms":1640,"queued_turn_count":0,"r